  message: "Retitled and rewrote description (2026-05-14): dropped 'WI-mafik Phase 2' framing — the relationship is disjoint scope, not parent-child. Dropped first two children (bakeoff-validation + extend polyglot fixture) which were really WI-mafik's scope; kept only the long-tail sweep scope (~90 analyzers in lang-mainstream/lang-common/lang-extended1 that still emit Edge.dst with dst_ref=None). Removed phase_2 tag."  # a1bc
