  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, linked-pile investigation): umbrella scope is verified against the codebase — `lua.py` (3 call sites), `perl.py`, `swift.py`, `kotlin.py`, `scala.py`, `php.py`, `groovy.py`, `powershell.py`, `objc.py` still call `make_unresolved_edge` without a `dst_ref=` kwarg, confirming the long-tail backlog. Java / Cpp / Rust / Ruby / Elixir / JS-TS / Go are excluded (Phase 1 retrofitted). The `needs_human_review` status remains correct until WI-kaziv produces bakeoff data to scope which long-tail analyzers warrant the retrofit."  # 655b
